# CODEOWNERS — review gating for sensitive changes.
# GitHub resolves the LAST matching pattern, so list general patterns first.

# Catch-all for /.github/ so CODEOWNERS, dependabot, workflows, etc. are
# themselves owned — otherwise a future PR could silently remove protections.
/.github/            @mediazard

# Core action logic and CI/CD (more specific overrides above where needed)
/src/                @mediazard
/dist/               @mediazard
/action.yml          @mediazard
/.github/workflows/  @mediazard
/package.json        @mediazard
/package-lock.json   @mediazard

# Security + contribution guidance
/SECURITY.md         @mediazard
/CONTRIBUTING.md     @mediazard

# README and docs — unowned (anyone can update)
